+# images cannot be configured apart. Public hashes and trust policy, not secrets. `|-` keeps the JSON
+# byte-exact with no trailing newline. (toJson escapes &, < and > as \u0026, \u003c, \u003e: the same
+# JSON value, which both consumers parse.)
